🚀 DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. Set environment variables:
   export VERCEL_TOKEN="your-token"
   export ELEVENLABS_API_KEY="your-key"
   export STRIPE_SECRET_KEY="your-key"
   export STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="your-key"

2. Run deployment:
   ./deploy.sh

OR use Railway/Vercel dashboard to set environment variables.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🔒 SECURITY BEST PRACTICES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

✅ DO:
- Use environment variables
- Store keys in secure vaults (1Password, LastPass, etc.)
- Rotate keys regularly
- Use different keys for dev/staging/prod
- Never commit keys to git

❌ DON'T:
- Hardcode keys in source code
- Commit keys to git
- Share keys in chat/email
- Use production keys in development
- Leave keys in deployment scripts

